              "marks": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": ": Choose one of the creature’s spell-like abilities, subject to the restrictions below. The creature can use that ability as an empowered spell-like ability three times per day (or less, if the ability is normally usable only once or twice per day)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "node_type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": "When a creature uses an empowered spell-like ability, all variable, numeric effects of the spell-like ability are increased by half (+50%). Saving throws and opposed rolls are not affected. Spell-like abilities without random variables are not affected."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "node_type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": "The creature can only select a spell-like ability duplicating a spell with a level less than or equal to 1/2 its caster level (round down) – 2. For a summary, see the table in the description of the Quicken Spell-Like Ability."
            }
